  "project_description": "The Media Library Widget Texts module adds the option to overwrite the texts used in the media library widget. This makes it possible, among other things, to change the text on the “Add media” button to “Add image,” for example.\n\n Back to top \n\n Dependencies \n \n Core Media Library module \n \n Back to top \n\n Installation \n Install as usual, see the documentation page about installing modules for further information.\n\n \n Sponsors \n Development on Media Library Widget Texts is sponsored by undpaul .\n\n Back to top",
